      "side": 1,
      "message": "The parameter cannot go on `urlsToReplicateTo` because that is the stateful one: asking it per `ref` would advance roundRobin\u0027s rotation for every ref instead of once per event, and `refsOwnedBy` asks the same question again at push time on another host, where a rotating counter would answer with its own position and filter every ref away. So I moved it off `Instance` instead: `Instance` is unchanged by this patch, and the `ref` question sits on the strategy `enum`, where being stateless is structural rather than a promise in the javadoc. distribute and `refsOwnedBy` moved with it, and `refsOwnedBy` no longer needs an `Instance`.",
